    "q-180265": {
      "dom_id": "step-q180265",
      "name": "Question 5",
      "problem": "If $-\\frac{8x}{5}+3=5$, then $x=${{field-1}}.",
      "worked_solution": "First, we isolate the fractional term $-\\frac{8x}{5}$ by subtracting $3$ from both sides:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-\\frac{8x}{5}+3 & =5 \\\\ -\\frac{8x}{5}+3-3 & =5-3 \\\\ -\\frac{8x}{5} & =2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe fractional coefficient is $-\\frac{8}{5},$ so we multiply by its reciprocal ${(-\\frac{8}{5})}^{-1}=-\\frac{5}{8}.$ This gives:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-\\frac{5}{8}\\cdot (-\\frac{8x}{5}) & =-\\frac{5}{8}\\cdot 2 \\\\ 1x & =-\\frac{10}{8} \\\\ x & =-\\frac{5}{4}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "field-1",
          "type": "blank",
          "dom_id": "freeResponseTextbox-1",
          "tag": "mathquill",
          "choices": [],
          "dom_index": 0,
          "disabled": false,
          "input_html": "<div id=\"freeResponseTextbox-1\" class=\"matheditor-wrapper-answer\" ;=\"\" style=\"min-width:35px;\n                                        margin-left:4px;\n                                        margin-right:-1px;\n                                        background:;\"><div class=\"mq-editable-field mq-math-mode\" style=\"border: none; outline: none;\"><span class=\"mq-textarea\"><textarea autocapitalize=\"off\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" x-palm-disable-ste-all=\"true\" style=\"\" disabled=\"\"></textarea></span><span class=\"mq-root-block\" mathquill-block-id=\"15\"><span mathquill-command-id=\"17\" class=\"\">−</span><span class=\"mq-fraction mq-non-leaf\" mathquill-command-id=\"19\"><span class=\"mq-numerator\" mathquill-block-id=\"21\"><span mathquill-command-id=\"20\">5</span></span><span class=\"mq-denominator\" mathquill-block-id=\"23\"><span mathquill-command-id=\"22\">4</span></span><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:0\">​</span></span></span></div></div>",
          "rendered_text": "−54​",
